# Types of Machine Learning

## 1. Supervised Learning
Data mein **input aur output (label)** dono hote hain. Model input se output ka relation seekhta hai.

**Types:**
- **Regression:** output continuous number (house price, temperature)
- **Classification:** output category (spam / not spam)

**Data types:**
- **Numerical:** numbers (age, price)
- **Categorical:** groups (gender, city). Model ko dene se pehle encode karna parta hai.

## 2. Unsupervised Learning
Data mein **sirf input**, koi label nahi. Model khud patterns dhoondta hai.

- **Clustering:** similar data ko groups mein baantna (K-Means, DBSCAN)
- **Dimensionality Reduction:** features kam karna, information barqarar rakhte hue (PCA)
- **Anomaly Detection:** unusual/outlier data pakarna (fraud detection)
- **Association Rule Learning:** items ke beech relations dhoondna (Apriori; "bread khareedne wale butter bhi khareedte hain")

## 3. Semi-Supervised Learning
Thora data **labeled**, zyada data **unlabeled**. Dono ko mila kar model train hota hai (jab labeling mehngi ho, jaise medical images).

## 4. Reinforcement Learning
**Agent** environment mein actions leta hai aur **reward/penalty** se seekhta hai ke kaunsa action behtar hai (game playing, robotics).
